sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Salesman / Customer
    actor W as Warehouse / QA Inspector
    actor A as Admin / Accountant
    participant RC as SalesmanReturnController
    participant RS as ReturnRequestService
    participant RIS as ReturnInspectionService
    participant RIV as ReturnInventoryService
    participant CS as CreditNoteService
    participant GL as JournalMappingService

    Note over S,GL: Step 1: Return Request Creation
    S->>RC: POST /salesman/returns (order_id, items[], reason)
    RC->>RS: createReturnRequest(actor, data, evidence)
    RS->>RS: Validate delivered order & returnable quantities
    RS-->>S: Return Request Created (RET-YYYY-MM-XXXX, Status: SUBMITTED)

    Note over W,GL: Step 2: Physical Inspection & Stock Disposition
    W->>RIS: completeInspection(returnRequest, inspector, itemDispositions[])
    alt Restockable Units
        RIS->>RIV: restockItems(items) -> Physical Stock +Qty (Movement: RETURN_IN)
    else Damaged / Scrap Units
        RIS->>RIV: writeOffItems(items) -> StockException / Damaged Logged
    end
    RIS-->>W: Inspection Completed (Status: INSPECTED / APPROVED)

    Note over A,GL: Step 3: Credit Note Issuance & Accounting
    A->>CS: createCreditNoteForReturn(returnRequest, actor)
    CS->>CS: Generate Credit Note (CN-YYYY-MM-XXXX)
    CS->>GL: postCreditNoteIssued(creditNote)
    GL-->>CS: GL Journal Posted (DR 4030 Sales Returns / DR 2100 Tax / CR 1100 AR)
    CS-->>A: Credit Note Issued & Customer AR Credited
